%% Source: docs-src/retries-and-resilience.md

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Caller
    participant T as AniLink transport
    participant H as Provider host

    C->>T: request A
    T->>H: send request
    H-->>T: 200, remaining quota below rateLimitFloor
    Note over T: records the reset deadline
    T-->>C: response A returns immediately
    C->>T: request B, same host
    Note over T: waits for the reset deadline
    Note over T: each wait capped at five minutes
    Note over C,T: onPace fires when the wait completes
    T->>H: send request, after the window resets
    H-->>T: 200
    T-->>C: response B
